notes: |
  The six files are the fork's at the commit above, the merge of #107, with no overlay: through #63
  (per-Session Git workspace: CreateSessionRequest.workspace = 6, Session.workspace = 16, message
  Workspace in common.proto) and #66 (per-Session credentials: CreateSessionRequest.credentials = 7,
  Session.credentials = 17, SessionCredential, SecretKeyReference), #73 (runtime composition:
  CreateSessionRequest.development_environment = 8, Session.development_environment = 18,
  Session.runtime_composition = 19, DevelopmentEnvironment, RuntimeComposition), #75
  (Session.runtime_association = 20, RuntimeAssociation), #86 (fresh-conversation forks:
  Session.fresh_conversation = 22, ForkSessionRequest.fresh_conversation = 3) and #87 (workspace
  preparation: rpc PrepareSessionWorkspace, its request and response, WorkspacePreparationReceipt,
  Session.workspace_preparation = 21) and #107 (workspace service: Workspace.service_command = 5).
  The field numbers are the 0.4 line's, which the overlay
  that carried them until #87 used too.

  To re-vendor: scripts/sync-kagent-protos.sh <oldsj/kagent checkout> <commit>, then update the
  commit above and deployedSourceRevision in source_test.go. Go and Connect clients are generated
  by `go generate ./...`, driven by server/tools/kagentproto (protocompile + protoc-gen-go +
  protoc-gen-connect-go; no buf CLI, since buf.yaml's module deps need BSR access this tree does
  not have).
